 / 45–60¢ rule, plus 3 consecutive polls where book imbalance I is strictly on the same side (I>0 for UP, I<0 for DOWN), $5","new":"Same T entry rule, plus 2 consecutive polls where I > −0.25 for UP or I < +0.25 for DOWN, $5","reason":"Zero trades in ~26 hours even though T filled three times in that span. On all three of those T fills, top-of-book imbalance I was on the opposite side (or nearly flat), so a strict same-side I>0 / I<0 filter could never agree. Lowered the agreement floor from 0 to −0.25 / +0.25 and required 2 agreeing snapshots instead of 3. That would have allowed 2 of T’s 3 live trades (the UP fill at I=−0.25 would still be blocked). Expected rate approaches T’s when the book is not strongly opposed (T’s 18-day backtest is ~10 trades/day / +$115 at $5; live T has been quieter)."}],"coinbase_lag":{"reachable":true,"samples":801,"last_price":63831.9,"last_diff_bp":-7.7206,"mean_abs_bp":4.1548},"btc_minutes":{"as_of":"6:52:05 AM PT","source":"BRTI","last":63836.14,"series":[{"ts":1795096380,"t":"5:53 AM","c":63882.11,"d":25.68,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795096440,"t":"5:54 AM","c":63849.71,"d":-32.4,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795096500,"t":"5:55 AM","c":63917.85,"d":68.14,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795096560,"t":"5:56 AM","c":63973.11,"d":55.26,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795096620,"t":"5:57 AM","c":63929.82,"d":-43.29,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795096680,"t":"5:58 AM","c":64007.04,"d":77.22,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795096740,"t":"5:59 AM","c":63979.89,"d":-27.15,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795096800,"t":"6:00 AM","c":63941.59,"d":-38.3,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795096860,"t":"6:01 AM","c":63935.92,"d":-5.67,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795096920,"t":"6:02 AM","c":63973.38,"d":37.46,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795096980,"t":"6:03 AM","c":63965.67,"d":-7.71,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795097040,"t":"6:04 AM","c":63959.43,"d":-6.24,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795097100,"t":"6:05 AM","c":63908.23,"d":-51.2,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795097160,"t":"6:06 AM","c":63917.17,"d":8.94,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795097220,"t":"6:07 AM","c":63883.34,"d":-33.83,